Yes. Fruits are very unique items in NetHack. Try the following in wiz-mode:

Name your fruit 'first', wish one and eat it. Name your fruit 'second', 
wish one and wish 'first'. You have one first and one second.

Any fruit that have existed in the game is wishable.

